eering leads.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Gates all P0 admin UI HLRs (create wizard, list, inspect, delete, status tracking) — the reuse determination changes the implementation approach for the frontend work.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":43394,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b79643b640be188f","agent_id":"af2e9536495148b77","session_id":"420e9024-f833-42df-9d31-a5dd457541d8","uuid":"655ad847-a06c-4f5d-a663-e9119d4d1f41","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:21:16.909Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8007"}
