create wizard, list page, and detail view are delivered and pass design review.\n- Designs reflect the TP form field set decided with the PM and Feature Store engineering.\n- Viewer (non-admin) read-only variants are documented, with write controls absent.\n- Delete confirmation and real-time status interaction patterns are specified.\n- Designs require no external network resources (air-gapped compatible).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Enables the P0 HLRs for the create wizard, list page, detail view, and delete flow (designs are prerequisites to implementation).\n- Covers the user-facing aspect of the P1 viewer read-only HLR.\n- Shapes the P2 inline validation guidance HLR.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":43394,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b79643b640be188f","agent_id":"af2e9536495148b77","session_id":"420e9024-f833-42df-9d31-a5dd457541d8","uuid":"0243ccb1-bda4-4f87-a271-de59f89d6221","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:21:27.771Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8007"}
