 removed).\n- RBAC enforcement is validated for admin and viewer personas, including direct K8s API write attempts by non-admin users being rejected.\n- Status tracking accuracy is validated against `.status.conditions` through the readiness transition.\n- A FeatureStore instance is successfully deployed from the dashboard on an air-gapped cluster with no external connectivity.\n- Dashboard pod resource consumption findings are recorded (no unexpected growth attributable to the new UI pages).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Validates the P0 HLRs: create wizard, list, inspect, delete, real-time status tracking.\n- Validates the P1 HLRs: viewer read-only access; disconnected/air-gapped operation.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":46112,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b79643b640be188f","agent_id":"af2e9536495148b77","session_id":"420e9024-f833-42df-9d31-a5dd457541d8","uuid":"fd75e4ee-8143-4c7a-8a8f-1f5b0be07135","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:22:37.958Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8007"}
