{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-801550ab2f9a0bbd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8007-E003\n3\ttitle: UXD wireframes and interaction patterns for the Feature Store admin UI\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8007\n5\tcomponent: UXD\n6\tteam: UXD Team\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8007-E001\n11\tai_signals:\n12\t  change_specificity: 0\n13\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n14\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n15\t  existing_foundation: 1\n16\t  open_questions: -1\n17\t  external_dependency: 0\n18\t  human_process_gates: -1\n19\t  repo_access: 1\n20\t  architecture_claims: 1\n21\timplementation_type: null\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: Medium\n24\tai_implementability_score: 2\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# UXD wireframes and interaction patterns for the Feature Store admin UI\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tThe UXD team produces wireframes and interaction patterns for the Feature Store admin management surface in the RHOAI dashboard: the guided create form wizard, the instance management list page, the read-only detail/inspect view, and the delete confirmation dialog. This discharges the `needs-uxd` obligation on the source RFE.\n35\t\n36\t## Scope\n37\t\n38\t- Wireframes for the create wizard: guided steps across the FeatureStore CRD field set selected for TP (namespace selection, registry type, online store backend, offline store backend, authorization mode, scaling parameters), including inline validation guidance presentation.\n39\t- Wireframes for the management list page: instance rows with name, namespace, deployment status, creation timestamp, and actions (inspect, delete).\n40\t- Wireframes for the read-only detail view: configured backends, authorization mode, scaling settings, TLS status, materialization schedule, and deployment conditions.\n41\t- Interaction patterns for the delete confirmation dialog, real-time status updates (deploying → ready), and error surfacing when the K8s API rejects a submission.\n42\t- Admin vs viewer (non-admin) variants: viewer users see list and detail views without create/delete controls.\n43\t- Designs must respect air-gapped constraints — no external assets or network-fetched resources.\n44\t- Use the engineering prototype (odh-dashboard draft PR #7013) as a starting design reference to unblock progress, per the strategy risk mitigation.\n45\t\n46\t## Acceptance Criteria\n47\t\n48\t- Wireframes and interaction patterns for the create wizard, list page, and detail view are delivered and pass design review.\n49\t- Designs reflect the TP form field set decided with the PM and Feature Store engineering.\n50\t- Viewer (non-admin) read-only variants are documented, with write controls absent.\n51\t- Delete confirmation and real-time status interaction patterns are specified.\n52\t- Designs require no external network resources (air-gapped compatible).\n53\t\n54\t## HLR Traceability\n55\t\n56\t- Enables the P0 HLRs for the create wizard, list page, detail view, and delete flow (designs are prerequisites to implementation).\n57\t- Covers the user-facing aspect of the P1 viewer read-only HLR.\n58\t- Shapes the P2 inline validation guidance HLR.\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-af9f54f7f25fdefb","agent_id":"a2027bdfb39992f71","session_id":"420e9024-f833-42df-9d31-a5dd457541d8","uuid":"ac1bf2ed-23d5-4b78-a015-c42b75837ab0","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:35:20.415Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-801550ab2f9a0bbd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8007 decomposition"}
