r-gapped constraints, feature-flag gating).\n37\t- Produce a reuse plan per admin UI surface — what to carry over, what to rebuild — confirmed with Dashboard and Feature Store engineering leads.\n38\t\n39\t## Acceptance Criteria\n40\t\n41\t- A written assessment documents where the prototype aligns with and diverges from the strategy approach, per admin UI surface.\n42\t- A reuse recommendation per surface (create wizard, list page, detail view, delete flow) is produced and confirmed with the Dashboard and Feature Store engineering leads.\n43\t\n44\t## HLR Traceability\n45\t\n46\t- Gates all P0 admin UI HLRs (create wizard, list, inspect, delete, status tracking) — the reuse determination changes the implementation approach for the frontend work.\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9bfe51b71a3ec8f6","agent_id":"a8179d2dd99a8dd90","session_id":"420e9024-f833-42df-9d31-a5dd457541d8","uuid":"d4f68453-732a-477b-b643-3f52e1852dee","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:39:07.353Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a141a892ad699b6d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8007 decomposition"}
