{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-adb60935f8602796","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8007-E008\n3\ttitle: QE validation of the Feature Store admin UI (CRUD, RBAC tiers, air-gapped)\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8007\n5\tcomponent: QE\n6\tteam: QE Team\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8007-E004\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8007-E005\n12\t- RHAISTRAT-8007-E006\n13\tai_signals:\n14\t  change_specificity: 1\n15\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n16\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n17\t  existing_foundation: 1\n18\t  open_questions: 0\n19\t  external_dependency: 0\n20\t  human_process_gates: 0\n21\t  repo_access: 1\n22\t  architecture_claims: 0\n23\timplementation_type: null\n24\tinvestigation_signals: null\n25\tai_implementability: High\n26\tai_implementability_score: 4\n27\tjira_key: null\n28\tbranch: null\n29\tgated_by: null\n30\tgate_failure_impact: null\n31\t---\n32\t# QE validation of the Feature Store admin UI (CRUD, RBAC tiers, air-gapped)\n33\t\n34\t## Description\n35\t\n36\tQE functionally validates the shipped Feature Store admin UI: end-to-end CRUD flows, admin vs viewer RBAC enforcement, real-time status tracking accuracy, and operation in a disconnected (air-gapped) environment. This covers the QE Team involvement identified in the strategy's impacted teams table.\n37\t\n38\t## Scope\n39\t\n40\t- End-to-end CRUD validation: create a FeatureStore instance via the guided wizard, verify it appears in the management list with correct status, inspect the detail view against the submitted spec, and delete it with confirmation — verifying operator cleanup of owned resources.\n41\t- RBAC enforcement validation for both personas: admins can create/delete; non-admin (viewer) users see list/detail without write controls and cannot write FeatureStore CRs even via direct K8s API access (UI-level hiding is not the enforcement boundary).\n42\t- Status tracking accuracy: list status matches `.status.conditions` within the dashboard's watch/poll cycle across the Deploying → Ready transition.\n43\t- Disconnected/air-gapped validation: deploy a FeatureStore instance from the dashboard on an air-gapped cluster with no external connectivity — no form options, validation rules, or UI assets may require external access.\n44\t- Monitor dashboard pod resource consumption in QE environments (risk mitigation for the 9+ container pod).\n45\t\n46\t## Acceptance Criteria\n47\t\n48\t- All CRUD flows pass end-to-end validation, including operator cleanup verification after delete (`kubectl get featurestore <name>` returns NotFound and owned resources are removed).\n49\t- RBAC enforcement is validated for admin and viewer personas, including direct K8s API write attempts by non-admin users being rejected.\n50\t- Status tracking accuracy is validated against `.status.conditions` through the readiness transition.\n51\t- A FeatureStore instance is successfully deployed from the dashboard on an air-gapped cluster with no external connectivity.\n52\t- Dashboard pod resource consumption findings are recorded (no unexpected growth attributable to the new UI pages).\n53\t\n54\t## HLR Traceability\n55\t\n56\t- Validates the P0 HLRs: create wizard, list, inspect, delete, real-time status tracking.\n57\t- Validates the P1 HLRs: viewer read-only access; disconnected/air-gapped operation.\n58\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9bfe51b71a3ec8f6","agent_id":"a8179d2dd99a8dd90","session_id":"420e9024-f833-42df-9d31-a5dd457541d8","uuid":"cd1841aa-eebe-4bff-8e75-ea886b81e600","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:39:58.462Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-adb60935f8602796","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8007 decomposition"}
